WEBVTT

00:03:29.956 --> 00:03:31.749
There's an element of serendipity.

00:03:31.791 --> 00:03:33.668
But when people do have fun,

00:03:33.668 --> 00:03:35.503
when they experience this feeling,

00:03:35.503 --> 00:03:37.296
it's actually very easy to recognize,

00:03:37.338 --> 00:03:39.006
because people who are having fun

00:03:39.006 --> 00:03:42.009
look like they're being
illuminated from within.

00:03:42.927 --> 00:03:44.095
So, for example,

00:03:44.095 --> 00:03:46.430
here is me and my husband
having fun together.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.600
Here are some presidents
having fun together.

00:03:49.642 --> 00:03:51.894
(Laughter)

00:03:51.936 --> 00:03:55.481
Here’s Archbishop Desmond Tutu
and the Dalai Lama having fun together.

00:03:55.481 --> 00:03:56.983
(Cheers and laughter)

00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:01.779
Actually, those two seemed like
they were very often, even constantly ...